# # /citl/
#
# https://w3id.org/citl/ redirects to the companion website of the lecture notes
# "Computers in the Loop: Digital Control from Sampling to Networked Agents" by Milad Siami
# (Northeastern University). The QR codes printed in the notes use these addresses.
#
#   https://w3id.org/citl/            -> https://siamilab.github.io/computers-in-the-loop/
#   https://w3id.org/citl/ch08        -> the page for Chapter 8 (ch01 to ch16)
#   https://w3id.org/citl/ch08/colab  -> the Chapter 8 notebook in Google Colab
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Milad Siami
# siami.assistant@gmail.com
# GitHub username: Siami-Lab

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^$ https://siamilab.github.io/computers-in-the-loop/ [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^(ch[0-9][0-9])/?$ https://siamilab.github.io/computers-in-the-loop/$1/ [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^(ch[0-9][0-9])/colab/?$ https://colab.research.google.com/github/SiamiLab/computers-in-the-loop/blob/main/notebooks/$1.ipynb [R=302,L]
